<title>UK: EDC sets 100 mln stg bond due Nov 1998.</title>
<headline>EDC sets 100 mln stg bond due Nov 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT DEVELOPMENT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    25.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     LISTING    NONE	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONTARIO   HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
